Z||000000||Will||11-13-2001||10:36 PM||||Chrysler Lebarons are on the wheel fitment list.<BR>Has anyone ever actually used LeBaron wheels on a Fiero?<BR>I want a pair of the 16x6 mesh wheels from 89-91 for the front to match a pair of 16x8 Turbo Grand Prix wheels in back.<BR>What model of LeBaron did the 16x6 wheels come on? @#$% <A HREF="http://www.carparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.carparts.com</A>  wants to know the exact model...||||reg||1
