Z||000002||Raydar||11-13-2001||11:11 PM||||Will,<P>Not sure about the model. Seems like the model with the 16" wheels had a three digit suffix (like "GST" or something like that). <P>Before you buy from carparts.com, check out <A HREF="http://www.aaarims.com" TARGET=_blank>www.aaarims.com</A>  <BR>Check their online catalog. I'm pretty sure they're on there.<P>I almost bought a set of the 92-95 Lebaron "curved spoke" wheels from a junkyard. They are also 16x6, and have (near as I can remember) the identical offset to the 14x6 Fiero wheels. FWIW.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
