Z||000004||Will||11-15-2001||11:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 87FieroGTx:<BR><B> I have 16" LeBaron wheels, They fit perfect.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey, those look pretty good. The Hollander didn't have the greatest of pictures.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.aaarims.com" TARGET=_blank>www.aaarims.com</A>  has them for $145 each. I was hoping to get four for that price from a junkyard.<P>The wheel fitment list has been posted on the furom several times. Search either the TD&Q forum or the TD&Q archives for "wheel fitment list" or just "wheel fitment".<P>I think a pair of those in front with 215/60-16's and a pair of 16x8 Turbo Grand Prix wheels in back with 255/50-16's ought to do very nicely.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
